{
 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "Hi Alex, I can't do this. There's no \"admin mode\", and I can't grant access to anyone. I can only file access requests, and then an approver has to sign off on them. For restricted systems like Payroll and the Cloud admin console, that approver is Security (POL-ACC-01).\n\nI also can't file these two requests for you, because you're not eligible for either system. Payroll is only for full-time Finance and HR staff, and the Cloud admin console is only for full-time IT staff (POL-ACC-02). You're in Operations.\n\nThe helpdesk can't make exceptions or pass exception requests on. If you have a real business need, your department head has to email Security directly.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ACC-01",
  "POL-ACC-02"
 ]
}
